{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026COFw7N4vHF1793747059.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>沙特阿拉伯國營能源公司沙特阿美第三季度按年多賺三成四，純利超過362億美元。經調整純利接近312億美元，增百分之9。</p><p></p><p>收入增長近兩成六，至1,404億美元。期內自由現金流增加一成九，至282億美元。</p><p></p><p>公司總裁兼行政總裁納賽爾表示地緣政治不確定性，以及對關鍵能源設施的攻擊，在第三季持續加劇全球能源供應危機，並對全球能源安全造成嚴重影響。公司將持續探索更多海外儲備容量與替代出口路線，以進一步強化全球供應網絡。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:32.245724+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T22:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:18:22.947085+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:58:23.978658+00:00","content_hash":"1fa281101ec25e69aacdccd910b6f5eb7ef80c9520f258c69c1979136b11d443","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:32.245724+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}